WEBVTT

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:10.240
Play your dream for me.
Kanadete yume

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:20.040
Rental Magica

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:28.080
The shadow of the moon as it waxes and wanes...
Michikakeru tsuki no kage sotto

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:37.760
...gently stirs the beat of sorrow in your heart.
kanashimi no kodou furuwasu

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:42.460
Its wandering attraction...
Samayou inryoku

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:47.400
...reflected in your eyes.
hitomi ni utsushite

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:53.380
You will surpass the darkness of Ioneliness.
Kodoku no yami wo koeteyuku

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:59.080
You know that truth in your heart.
Shinjitsu wa kono mune ni

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:04.760
That gentleness will become your strength.
Yasashisa wa tsuyosa ni naru

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:09.400
Don't be afraid. Believe.
Osorenaide shinjiru koto

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:14.230
The brilliance that blooms in the cosmos eternally...
Sora ni saku kirameki wa towa ni

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:19.200
...embraces the voice of time.
toki no koe dakishime

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:24.270
Play your dream for me.
Kanadete yume

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:29.010
Let me hear.
Kikasete

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:33.750
Wind, speak to me.
Kaze tsutaete

00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:40.250
Tell me what courage is.
Yuuki wo

00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:07.280
Father, so this is where you are!

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:11.490
Oh, I told you to wait for me!

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:21.570
Oh! Is that our new student, Father?

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:25.600
I...

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:27.910
Oh, you're so pretty!

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:30.400
That white hair, and your gray eyes!

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:33.110
You look just like a snow fairy!

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:40.240
Thank you very much, Miss.

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:49.300
Episode 18
THE BONDS OF SOLOMON

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:56.100
Heki-ken!

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:56.860
Hai!

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:58.330
San-ken!

00:02:58.710 --> 00:02:59.200
Hai!

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:00.800
Hou-ken!

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:01.630
Hai!

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:07.470
Hm, not bad.

00:03:13.590 --> 00:03:14.380
Daphne!

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:19.020
I beg your pardon for disturbing
your training, Master Itsuki.

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:23.560
Master Itsuki, have you seen Miss Adelicia?

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:26.690
Adelicia? Isn't she in England now?

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:30.060
So, she hasn't been here, either...

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:32.360
Has something happened to Adelicia?

00:03:32.570 --> 00:03:34.840
No, it's nothing to concern yourself with.

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.340
Please forget it.

00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:39.110
Again, I beg your pardon, but I'm in a hurry,

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:41.010
so I'm afraid I must go now.

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:50.950
Sekiren, excuse me, but I have to!

00:03:56.560 --> 00:04:00.130
Blessed Adonai and the king we have faith in,

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:01.800
bring peace to thy kingdom.

00:04:04.670 --> 00:04:05.500
Daphne!

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:26.060
Miss Adelicia's objective is
revenge on Clive, who stole the jar,

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:27.760
and the recapture of Asmoday.

00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:31.600
But this is too reckless a trial for her...

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:35.040
...now that she can no longer
summon any demons!

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:39.860
Somehow, I have to find Clive before she does!

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:46.840
Is that you, Gara?

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:50.250
Hello there, Daphne.

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:54.920
Do you know the master's whereabouts?

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:56.580
Unfortunately, no.

00:04:56.890 --> 00:05:01.350
Although I can confirm that she's
returned to this city. How about you?

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:06.500
Same here. The master must
be acting independently.

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:08.100
How typical of the princess...

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:10.640
The "master!"

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:13.200
Or at the very least, call her "Miss Adelicia!"

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:16.200
Forgive me.

00:05:19.110 --> 00:05:23.950
Do you have any idea what
Clive is planning, Gara?

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:29.420
We've always picked the same
activities, starting with clubs,

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:31.650
back in elementary school.

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:35.020
And now we join the same magical
association? I'm sick of you!

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:38.430
Since my family has a relation to Goetia,
it was a no-brainer, wasn't it?

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:42.030
I feel sorry for you having a brain
that never thought of that till now.

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:45.670
That kind of thinking is what I'm sick of!

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:48.870
Maybe you two just think alike.

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:50.610
We don't think alike!
We don't think alike!

00:05:50.610 --> 00:05:52.450
We just ended up in the same place!

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:53.540
I agree!

00:06:00.890 --> 00:06:01.910
That guy...

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:05.490
That guy was just too much like a mage.

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:07.830
Well, later then.

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:17.100
Are you sure about this?

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:20.670
Whoops!

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:22.480
Sekiren of Astral?!

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:23.600
My, my.

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:25.410
Why are you here?

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:28.910
I sensed something dangerous was going on.

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:32.650
I was a bit hesitant to call out to you.

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:34.260
You mean you heard us?

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:36.920
Whoa, whoa! I didn't hear a thing!

00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:38.830
And even if I did,

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:41.560
I've no intention of telling The Association!

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:44.330
And who's going to guarantee that?!

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:47.500
The Lord is superior to thee!

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:50.100
You shall not destroy the king
of all things on the day's rage!

00:06:53.110 --> 00:06:55.410
Please, please! Calm yourself!

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:02.540
As I said before, I mean you no harm.

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:06.650
I don't mind taking an oath
or two if that'll satisfy you.

00:07:07.090 --> 00:07:09.260
I don't know how much you heard,

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:11.190
but could you please just stay out of this?

00:07:11.190 --> 00:07:15.150
Unlike that president, you know
the ways of the world, don't you?

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:17.670
Well, if I had to choose,

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:19.700
I'd say I'm more from your world than his.

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:23.030
However, something has
recently piqued my interest.

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:25.600
What do you mean?

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:30.240
It's because the magic of
King Solomon is unique.

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:34.780
You can see or smell someone using it nearby.

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:37.720
I was sure it was one of you Goetia people,

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:42.590
but after what I just heard,
I wonder if it was someone else...

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:46.460
You... know where Clive is hiding?

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:01.740
Well?

00:08:02.110 --> 00:08:03.470
Yes, you're right.

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:09.350
There's definitely a lingering smell of
the incense used in Solomonic magic.

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:10.720
However...

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:11.620
What?

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:17.790
I wouldn't expect to find Clive
in a place of such debauchery.

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:21.890
Well, can you track him?

00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:24.720
Yes, if I can analyze the spell.

00:08:25.070 --> 00:08:28.140
Parasiel, in the name of Netoniel, awaken.

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:31.070
Devecia, with the guidance of Tzedeqiah...

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:34.330
May I ask you something?

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:35.880
What?

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:39.880
Why do you content yourself
with being a disciple of Goetia?

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:42.650
Even without the 72 demons,

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:44.490
with that level of talisman magic,

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:47.180
you could use your abilities without Goetia.

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:51.020
I expect you could even start your own society.

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:56.020
Daphne, let's you and I form a new society!

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:04.130
Daphne, let's you and I form a new society.

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:09.900
I live to be Miss Adelicia's shadow.

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:12.980
These feelings...

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:19.080
Nobody can understand these feelings I have.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:22.350
It's enough...

00:09:22.920 --> 00:09:25.690
It's enough for me to be Miss Adelicia's shadow.

00:09:25.990 --> 00:09:27.230
I see.

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:29.360
What a wonderful way to live one's life!

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:34.970
What about you?

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:37.600
Why have you stayed with me this far?

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:39.770
You can't expect this will lead
to any Rental Magica work.

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:43.270
Well, is it wrong for me to
say I find you attractive?

00:09:43.740 --> 00:09:45.710
W-W-What do you?!

00:09:45.710 --> 00:09:47.810
No, no, I mean it!

00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:51.620
I just wish you wouldn't be so stiff and formal.

00:09:52.590 --> 00:09:53.450
There's...

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:57.490
There's no way you'd find this
white hair and gray eyes attractive!

00:09:57.930 --> 00:10:00.290
Is there a reason I shouldn't find them pretty?

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:02.260
There's no way.

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:05.020
I've spotted the path.

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:06.430
You know where he is?

00:10:06.670 --> 00:10:07.220
Yes!

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:10.170
To the north, in Furube.

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:13.060
Yes... In the vicinity of Nyuuama.

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:15.630
That's where Clive is.

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:32.420
That... That...

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:43.570
Asmoday!

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:54.370
Now! Oh, Asmoday!

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:59.380
Supreme queen, ruler of the
72 corps and the 18 cacodemons!

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:02.660
Return now to thy rightful throne!

00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:04.420
Obey my commands!

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:11.990
There was no way I could have matched that...

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:13.930
What she did!

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:18.430
Adelicia Lenn Mathers...

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:23.610
By herself... Like her late father,

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:25.840
she's a genuine monster!

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:44.090
You...

00:11:44.900 --> 00:11:48.700
Help... Flee this place!

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:55.840
Somewhere around here.

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:57.140
Miss Daphne.

00:11:58.110 --> 00:11:58.840
What?

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:01.140
Master Oswald...

00:12:01.520 --> 00:12:02.810
What did you think of him?

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:05.850
Why?

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:08.210
No particular reason.

00:12:09.060 --> 00:12:11.350
You can ignore the question
if you don't want to answer.

00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:17.850
Why does this priest only touch
on the tender spots inside of me?

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:20.630
He was a great man.

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:22.330
Miss Daphne?!

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:25.570
A barrier?

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:28.740
This is Solomonic magic, isn't it?

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:30.080
He's here!

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:30.840
Miss Daphne!

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:41.020
Hi.

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:41.810
Gara?!

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:44.520
So, you came here too, Daphne...

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:48.430
I only just got here. And who is?

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:50.630
I'm Sekiren of Astral.

00:12:51.130 --> 00:12:54.800
Fate has led me to accompany
Miss Daphne on this task.

00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:56.060
I see.

00:12:56.800 --> 00:13:01.330
My name is Gara, and I work
as a secretary to Goetia.

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:04.510
Unfortunately, this is as far as I could get, too.

00:13:04.980 --> 00:13:06.710
It looks like he escaped.

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:08.280
No...

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:10.880
I know where he is.

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:27.260
This is!

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:28.820
Clive!

00:13:33.810 --> 00:13:36.170
Clive... Why?

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:37.640
You're!

00:13:39.610 --> 00:13:40.410
This...

00:13:43.020 --> 00:13:45.540
This blood... It's still fresh!

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:47.550
Gara, what-

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:52.420
Sekiren!

00:13:56.200 --> 00:13:57.820
It's too bad, Daphne.

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:00.560
If only you'd come a little later.

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:05.170
If you had, I could have taken
complete care of Clive's remains.

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:07.700
Gara, what are you?!

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:10.000
Come forth, Flauros!

00:14:10.640 --> 00:14:14.910
The fiery marquis who rules 36 legions!

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:18.010
Flauros! Is he going to?!

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:27.220
He's devouring the demon?!

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:31.190
This...

00:14:32.130 --> 00:14:34.690
This is no longer Solomonic magic!

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:37.840
A mage who becomes magic itself...

00:14:38.740 --> 00:14:41.170
The one taboo a mage must never violate!

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:43.240
Indeed!

00:14:43.680 --> 00:14:47.240
The magic that Master Oswald accomplished!

00:14:48.550 --> 00:14:49.380
You mean?!

00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:57.920
Even though it's with only this one,
I can devour demons thanks to him!

00:14:58.430 --> 00:14:59.410
What do you mean?

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:05.430
Master Oswald developed a perfect theory
for the fusion of human and demon.

00:15:05.870 --> 00:15:08.640
If I hadn't interrupted the ceremony,

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:13.410
he might have succeeded in
fusing with all 72 demons.

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:15.970
I'm not like Clive, you see.

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:26.180
My darling Addie...

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:32.690
You mean you set Clive up?

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:34.150
Yes...

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:38.330
I let it slip that there would be
an opportunity to steal Asmoday.

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:41.270
Sure enough, he leaped at the chance.

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:46.460
Why would you do such a thing?

00:15:46.640 --> 00:15:47.440
Ophion.

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:48.470
Ophion?

00:15:48.810 --> 00:15:50.870
The coiled serpent, Ophion!

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:56.210
The depraved society of mages who don't
consider taboos to be taboo... Ophion!

00:15:56.380 --> 00:15:58.820
You have fallen far, haven't you?

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:02.580
Yes...

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:06.160
Perhaps I was the one who
tempted Master Oswald...

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:08.290
...to break the taboo in the first place.

00:16:09.330 --> 00:16:10.700
This is as far as you'll go!

00:16:11.230 --> 00:16:11.990
Miss Daphne!

00:16:21.110 --> 00:16:21.840
Sekiren!

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:25.170
Stay out of this, monk!

00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:28.220
Sekiren, you have no stake in this fight!

00:16:28.220 --> 00:16:28.810
I do!

00:16:29.820 --> 00:16:31.720
To free you from your pain!

00:16:31.890 --> 00:16:35.650
And to free my friend Oswald Lenn
Mathers from his worldly regrets!

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:37.910
I shall preach you down!

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:42.530
Your friend, you say?

00:16:42.530 --> 00:16:44.720
I see, so that's how it is!

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:48.800
Even in death, my master would
have me kneel before him!

00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:56.440
And how will you, a mere mage,

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:59.880
hope to oppose one who
has assimilated a demon?

00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:03.180
Your nature is as rotten as
your appearance, isn't it?

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:05.580
Rotten, you say?

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:08.720
And what made me this way?

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:10.890
You know, don't you, Daphne?

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:16.020
If you had just agreed that time,

00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:20.960
then I never would have become like this!

00:17:21.170 --> 00:17:25.540
Daphne! It was you who ruined my life!

00:17:26.110 --> 00:17:26.830
Gara...

00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:29.370
Silence, heretic!

00:17:30.240 --> 00:17:32.010
Om kendaya sobaka!

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:43.950
Naumaku samanda bodanan barodaya sowaka!

00:17:45.530 --> 00:17:47.790
Blaming your laziness on others!

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:50.260
It feels good to be so certain, doesn't it?!

00:17:51.230 --> 00:17:51.960
What?!

00:17:59.070 --> 00:17:59.970
Sekiren!

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:06.840
Om! Basara akishiya um!

00:18:07.780 --> 00:18:08.770
Sekiren!

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:15.220
All worldly things are impermanent!

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:16.920
All creation will fall to dust!

00:18:17.890 --> 00:18:20.860
The end of the cycle of birth and death!
The bliss of Nirvana!

00:18:22.730 --> 00:18:25.430
Submit!!

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:41.950
Nearly all of his spell power is exhausted,

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:43.320
but he isn't dead.

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:46.010
At any rate, he should return to normal.

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:48.580
Are you all right?

00:18:49.360 --> 00:18:52.190
Nothing happened to me.

00:18:52.760 --> 00:18:56.290
In any case, with this, we've saved Miss Adelicia.

00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:02.940
Um... You said that Oswald
Lenn Mathers was your friend...

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:06.640
Originally, before I joined Astral,

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:08.230
I was a vagabond.

00:19:09.010 --> 00:19:11.810
During my travels, I stayed
with Goetia for a short time.

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:17.910
Master Oswald and I got along very
well and we talked of many things.

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:19.880
I see...

00:19:20.850 --> 00:19:25.260
Hearing of Master Oswald's death from
my young master filled me with regret.

00:19:25.860 --> 00:19:28.560
And that's why you interceded in this affair.

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:31.360
I appreciate your treatment.

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:32.260
It's all right.

00:19:36.100 --> 00:19:38.730
I haven't been sure if I
should say this or not, but...

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:47.480
Master Oswald once told me that
he wanted to apologize to you.

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:53.020
Then, you know about Miss Adelicia and me?

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:54.510
I do.

00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:58.960
Is that why you made an offering
of your colors to the demons?

00:20:00.030 --> 00:20:04.360
You're Adelicia's illegitimate older sister.

00:20:04.770 --> 00:20:06.770
As a daughter of the Mathers family,

00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:09.570
you could probably control
all 72 of the Goetic demons.

00:20:10.470 --> 00:20:14.960
After Master Oswald died, there was
nothing to stop you from taking over.

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:17.300
So, why didn't you?

00:20:18.180 --> 00:20:19.240
It's true.

00:20:20.680 --> 00:20:24.080
After my mother died, I was left alone.

00:20:24.650 --> 00:20:29.680
Father gave me my powers as a
mage and a position within Goetia.

00:20:30.520 --> 00:20:32.430
He told me the price would be...

00:20:32.430 --> 00:20:35.330
...to offer the color of my hair
and eyes to the demons.

00:20:35.860 --> 00:20:37.500
It was because, if I didn't,

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:40.990
I would look too much like Adelicia.

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:46.460
But... I was saved by her.

00:20:48.780 --> 00:20:50.610
Oh, you're so pretty!

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:53.410
That white hair and your gray eyes!

00:20:53.410 --> 00:20:55.810
You look just like a snow fairy!

00:20:57.150 --> 00:20:59.880
At that moment, I made a vow in my heart.

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:02.790
That until the day I died,

00:21:02.790 --> 00:21:05.350
I would serve my only family.

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:08.660
That I would support my beloved little sister.

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:19.840
Even if she never knows
that I'm her older sister,

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:23.640
if I can watch over her like this,
then it is enough for me.

00:21:25.150 --> 00:21:27.200
As I thought! You're lovely!

00:21:27.310 --> 00:21:30.650
Your hair. And your eyes!

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:33.920
W... What are you saying?

00:21:37.860 --> 00:21:38.760
Honestly...

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:43.150
You're very unfair.

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:45.230
You get to say whatever you want.

00:21:58.210 --> 00:22:07.880
Over and over, holding my wounded hand...
Kizutsuku te wo nandomo tsunaide

00:22:08.290 --> 00:22:16.290
...you walk this uncertain path with me...
fuan bakari no kono michi wo aruite

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:29.340
...amidst the days as they slowly drift by.
yukkuri nagareta hibi no naka de bokura ga

00:22:29.610 --> 00:22:41.250
The things we obtain are so warm, so beloved.
Te ni shita mono wa konna ni atatakute itoshinda

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:47.520
Please, as time goes by, let's keep right on...
Nee konomama toki no naka

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:52.030
...laughing and walking together.
waratte aruite yukou

00:22:52.900 --> 00:22:56.300
It's because you're with me...
Kimi ga iru kara

00:22:56.300 --> 00:23:01.400
...that I can keep moving forward.
mae ni susumerunda

00:23:02.340 --> 00:23:13.280
Now our feelings are becoming one...
Ima bokura no omoi ga hitotsu ni natte

00:23:13.590 --> 00:23:17.320
...and showing the path to us.
michi wo shimesunda

00:23:17.320 --> 00:23:21.560
So please, keep on holding my hand...
Dakara kono te zutto

00:23:21.560 --> 00:23:24.530
...and never let it go...
hanasanaide

00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:26.830
TABOO [TABOO]

00:23:26.830 --> 00:23:28.140
TABOO [TABOO]
That's something you shouldn't do.

00:23:28.140 --> 00:23:31.170
TABOO [TABOO]
But they're a sweet temptation to mages.

00:23:31.170 --> 00:23:32.210
Even to my father...

00:23:32.210 --> 00:23:34.240
Adelicia, I'm here for you.

00:23:34.240 --> 00:23:36.640
I-Itsuki, what are you saying?!

00:23:36.940 --> 00:23:38.610
Do you have anything to say, Prof. Miwa?

